(why the Zai seats aren't enough) The Zai agents are doing well: tonight's fixes from them were careful and well tested. But only 3 seats are free, and each is held by one job for 1–2 hours:
- zai-1: the `ite` condition fix;
- zai-2: dot-notation;
- zai-3: the long re-probe.
